WEBVTT

01:36.240 --> 01:38.660
Found ya!

01:38.660 --> 01:41.030
You're the last one alive, asshole.

01:41.030 --> 01:42.280
Get the fuck up!

01:43.660 --> 01:46.160
Welcome to hell!

01:46.160 --> 01:49.040
And now I'm gonna strip the skin off yer face.

01:49.040 --> 01:50.210
You don't mind, right?

01:50.830 --> 01:52.290
What are you doing?!

01:52.290 --> 01:53.210
Huh?

01:53.210 --> 01:56.090
Hurry up and do it!

01:56.090 --> 01:58.260
Rip that skin off right now.

01:59.340 --> 02:02.760
Come on, let's give 'im a proper send-off, Scatter-SAN.

02:02.760 --> 02:04.680
He's the last one left alive, you know?

02:04.680 --> 02:08.140
His is the last life sign remaining.

02:08.140 --> 02:10.100
Apart from us two, that is.

02:15.650 --> 02:19.320
With so few survivors,
I'm gettin' all frustrated!

02:19.320 --> 02:23.240
That's because Dark NINJA-SAN killed most of them when the fight started.

02:23.240 --> 02:25.870
That guy's got no sense of style, ya know?

02:27.250 --> 02:30.460
Cry for your life, 'cause you're knockin' on death's door!

02:30.460 --> 02:31.750
Slain...

02:31.750 --> 02:33.000
Huh?

02:33.340 --> 02:34.750
Must be slain...

02:35.050 --> 02:36.760
You want us to kill you?

02:36.760 --> 02:38.630
Must be slain!

02:38.970 --> 02:39.760
Huh?

02:47.600 --> 02:49.480
GWARGGH!

02:49.480 --> 02:50.770
Offender-SAN!

02:51.060 --> 02:53.310
NINJA must be slain!

02:53.650 --> 02:56.270
Who... ARE you?

02:59.360 --> 03:00.740
YEEART!

03:00.740 --> 03:02.740
GWAAARGHGHHHH!

03:07.040 --> 03:09.960
But I'm a NINJA… This can't be…

03:09.960 --> 03:10.660
YEEART!

03:10.660 --> 03:12.710
GWARGH!

03:12.710 --> 03:14.920
But I'm a NINJA…

03:14.920 --> 03:15.590
YEEART!

03:15.590 --> 03:17.300
GWARGH!

03:23.840 --> 03:26.970
GWAAARGGGGH…

03:27.390 --> 03:30.890
But… I'm… a… NINJA…

03:31.600 --> 03:33.850
NINJA must be slain!

03:34.810 --> 03:36.400
YEEART!

03:36.400 --> 03:38.070
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

03:38.070 --> 03:39.190
SAYŌNARA!

03:42.150 --> 03:44.570
What the... What the…?!

03:44.570 --> 03:47.740
The bosses didn't say nothin' about this!

04:07.640 --> 04:08.390
DŌMO.

04:10.970 --> 04:13.140
I am NINJA Slayer.

04:18.360 --> 04:22.490
The AISATSU is a divine, sacred rite to those NINJA who are about to begin the IKUSA.

04:18.360 --> 04:22.490
Note: IKUSA is a battle between NINJA.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.490
It is written in the KOJIKI.

04:22.490 --> 04:24.490
Note: KOJIKI tells of NINJA.

04:24.490 --> 04:27.870
When given the AISATSU,
you must AISATSU back!

04:24.490 --> 04:27.870
Note: AISATSU is a NINJA bow.

04:29.740 --> 04:32.160
D-DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.830
I am Offender.

04:33.830 --> 04:35.420
What the hell are you doing?!

04:35.790 --> 04:36.420
Slaying.

04:36.420 --> 04:37.540
Why?!

04:38.080 --> 04:40.050
Because you are a NINJA!

04:40.050 --> 04:41.380
No!

04:41.380 --> 04:42.130
YEEART!

04:42.130 --> 04:43.880
GWAAAGGH!

04:45.800 --> 04:48.760
Now you must read your HAIKU, Offender-SAN.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.760
Note: A defeated NINJA must read a HAIKU before he dies in combat.

04:49.350 --> 04:51.180
No, I don't wanna die!

04:51.180 --> 04:52.390
YEEART!

04:53.520 --> 04:54.600
SAYŌNARA!

04:58.440 --> 05:00.440
Screw you, pig!

05:00.440 --> 05:01.780
Back the fuck off!

05:01.780 --> 05:03.110
Stop this!

05:03.110 --> 05:04.150
Go around!

05:04.150 --> 05:05.700
This area is dangerous!

05:05.700 --> 05:07.950
Like I'm scared of you cops!

05:07.950 --> 05:10.280
A fire? An explosion?

05:10.280 --> 05:12.830
That's <i>your</i> problem!

05:12.830 --> 05:14.910
I got business tomorrow!

05:14.910 --> 05:16.330
I'm tellin' the boss.

05:16.330 --> 05:18.630
It's my problem, you think?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.420
YEEART!

05:19.330 --> 05:20.420
GWARGH!

05:20.420 --> 05:23.630
Show some fuckin' respect, you drunk!

05:23.630 --> 05:25.510
YEEART! YEEART!

05:23.630 --> 05:25.510
GWARGH! GWARGH!

05:25.510 --> 05:27.050
You think we got it any better?!

05:27.050 --> 05:28.180
YEEART!

05:28.180 --> 05:31.300
YEEART! YEEART! YEEART!

05:31.300 --> 05:33.180
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

05:31.300 --> 05:33.180
Note: NAMU AMIDA BUTSU is BUDDHIST.

05:49.450 --> 05:50.990
Fuyuko.

05:50.990 --> 05:52.330
Tochinoki.

06:00.460 --> 06:02.670
Fujikido Kenji.

06:02.670 --> 06:04.960
I am Fujikido Kenji!

06:05.960 --> 06:07.840
Indeed, you are!

06:08.260 --> 06:11.850
DŌMO, Fujikido Kenji-SAN.

06:11.850 --> 06:13.890
I am NARAKU NINJA.

06:13.890 --> 06:16.220
DŌMO, NARAKU NINJA-SAN.

06:16.220 --> 06:18.440
Who in the world are you?!

06:18.440 --> 06:19.310
Are you a NINJA?

06:19.310 --> 06:21.980
Indubitably. I am indeed a NINJA.

06:21.980 --> 06:25.070
A NINJA who slays NINJA.

06:25.070 --> 06:28.950
You and I shall have our revenge together!

06:28.950 --> 06:31.700
NINJA must be slain!

06:31.700 --> 06:32.740
That's right.

06:32.740 --> 06:35.080
NINJA killed Fuyuko and Tochinoki…

06:35.080 --> 06:40.290
Your wife and child are dead,
and they were killed by NINJA.

06:40.290 --> 06:45.300
You, too, were on the brink of death,
but yea, it was I who pulled you back.

06:45.550 --> 06:49.930
Yes! And I did it to give you a chance to take revenge!

06:49.930 --> 06:51.470
Revenge…

06:56.220 --> 06:58.310
Yes, indeed!

06:58.310 --> 07:02.060
Leave everything to me! Slay them!

07:02.060 --> 07:03.940
This cross-KATANA emblem

07:03.940 --> 07:07.440
is the symbol of the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE,
who killed his family.

07:07.440 --> 07:10.070
They think nothing of killing people like insects,

07:10.070 --> 07:13.280
and believe themselves invincible and unbeatable.

07:13.280 --> 07:16.740
He shall plunge them into black terror, and destroy them.

07:16.740 --> 07:19.790
How wonderful that experience shall be!

07:19.790 --> 07:25.090
Fujikido realized now who the NINJA staring back at him in the mirror was.

07:25.090 --> 07:29.090
He had become a NINJA who slays NINJA!

07:29.090 --> 07:31.010
The NINJA Slayer!

07:31.010 --> 07:32.590
YEEART!

07:32.590 --> 07:34.010
AIYEEE!

07:34.010 --> 07:34.890
NINJA?!

07:34.890 --> 07:36.470
Why, NINJA?!

07:39.310 --> 07:40.430
YEEART!

07:41.310 --> 07:42.640
AIYEEE...

07:43.140 --> 07:44.900
AIYEERGGH!

07:58.330 --> 08:01.960
Taken damage, have you?
I won't give you a chance to rest!

08:01.960 --> 08:03.040
YEEART!

08:12.220 --> 08:13.680
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE.

08:15.340 --> 08:17.600
I am NINJA Slayer.

08:22.140 --> 08:25.150
DŌMO, HAJIMEMASHITE,
NINJA Slayer-SAN.

08:25.520 --> 08:27.060
I am Myrmidon.

08:29.400 --> 08:31.320
It is the witching hour, when others sleep.

08:31.320 --> 08:35.570
And the proud Honorable TORII becomes now a place of NINJA IKUSA!

08:31.320 --> 08:35.570
NOTE: TORII are gates to NINJA shrines.

08:35.950 --> 08:38.280
You came after me as soon as you could, huh?

08:38.280 --> 08:39.740
You filthy rat!

08:40.040 --> 08:42.500
YEEART!

08:48.500 --> 08:54.090
Now you will learn what a sin it is to anger the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE!

08:54.090 --> 08:57.140
That cross-KATANA emblem…

08:57.140 --> 08:59.010
So you call yourselves the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE?

08:59.010 --> 08:59.800
I will remember that!

08:59.800 --> 09:02.020
Tell me what it is you're after.

09:02.350 --> 09:03.890
To slay NINJA!

09:03.890 --> 09:05.520
Of course, that includes you.

09:05.520 --> 09:07.980
I will kill all the NINJA of SŌKAIYA!

09:08.270 --> 09:10.190
I will kill all NINJA everywhere!

09:10.190 --> 09:12.610
That's the raving of a madman!

09:13.110 --> 09:14.990
Am I truly raving?

09:16.910 --> 09:17.740
YEEART!

09:19.780 --> 09:21.740
GWAAARGH!

09:23.240 --> 09:26.000
Despite the heavy armor woven into his NINJA outfit,

09:26.000 --> 09:28.830
he is, in fact, incredibly agile.

09:28.830 --> 09:31.170
However, his warrior instincts,

09:31.170 --> 09:33.420
or perhaps the NINJA soul within him,

09:33.420 --> 09:36.170
made him fear the techniques of the enemy before him!

09:36.170 --> 09:38.380
The techniques of this NINJA!

09:40.050 --> 09:40.890
YEEART!

09:43.850 --> 09:45.020
GWARGH!

09:51.480 --> 09:53.650
GWAAARGGGH!

09:54.360 --> 09:55.610
SAYŌNARA!

10:12.290 --> 10:17.380
Thus, three NINJA became the first victims of the NINJA SLAYER.

10:17.380 --> 10:22.720
Compared to the mountains of gore soon to come from this merciless killer,

10:22.720 --> 10:26.310
this was but the tiniest of preludes.

10:26.310 --> 10:27.560
YEEART!

10:36.780 --> 10:39.150
DŌZO, master!

10:44.990 --> 10:46.620
Throw it all away!

10:55.920 --> 10:57.670
As you say, sir.
